    "Html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"it\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\" xmlns:o=\"urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office\">\n<head>\n  <title>Notifica delega: un ente ti ha scelto come Partner tecnologico</title>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n  <meta name=\"color-scheme\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <meta name=\"supported-color-schemes\" content=\"light dark\">\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n    #outlook a { padding:0; }\n    body { margin:0;padding:0;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%; }\n    table, td { border-collapse:collapse;mso-table-lspace:0pt;mso-table-rspace:0pt; }\n    img { border:0;height:auto;line-height:100%;outline:none;text-decoration:none;-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic; }\n    p { display:block;margin:0 0 13px; }\n  </style>\n  <!--[if mso]>\n  <noscript>\n    <xml>\n      <o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\n        <o:AllowPNG/>\n        <o:PixelsPerInch>96</o:PixelsPerInch>\n      </o:OfficeDocumentSettings>\n    </xml>\n  </noscript>\n  <![endif]-->\n  <!--[if lte mso 11]>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n    .mj-outlook-group-fix { width:100% !important; }\n  </style>\n  <![endif]-->\n  <!--[if !mso]><!-->\n  <link href=\"https://selfcare.pagopa.it/assets/font/selfhostedfonts.css\" rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\">\n  <!--<![endif]-->\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n    @media only screen and (min-width:480px) {\n      .mj-column-per-100 { width:100% !important;max-width:100%; }\n    }\n  </style>\n  <style media=\"screen and (min-width:480px)\">\n    .moz-text-html .mj-column-per-100 { width:100% !important;max-width:100%; }\n  </style>\n  <style type=\"text/css\">\n    :root { color-scheme:light dark;supported-color-schemes:light dark; }\n    body, .mail-body, .header, .section { background-color:#FFFFFF; }\n    .text div { color:#17324D !important; }\n    .footer-text, .footer-text div { color:#5C6F82 !important; }\n    .link, .footer-text a, .text a { color:#0073E6 !important; }\n\n    @media (prefers-color-scheme:light) {\n      .dark-img, [data-ogsc] .dark-img { display:none !important;mso-hide:all !important; }\n      .light-img, [data-ogsc] .light-img { display:block !important; }\n    }\n\n    @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark) {\n      body, .mail-body, .header, .section { background-color:#323232; }\n      .text div { color:#eeeeee !important; }\n      .footer-text, .footer-text div { color:#CCD4DC !important; }\n      .footer-text a, .text a { color:#94C4F4 !important; }\n      .dark-img, [data-ogsc] .dark-img {\n        display:block !important;\n        overflow:visible !important;\n        float:none !important;\n        margin-top:0px !important;\n        visibility:inherit !important;\n      }\n      tr.dark-img, [data-ogsc] tr.dark-img { display:table-row !important; }\n      .light-img, [data-ogsc] .light-img { display:none !important;mso-hide:all !important; }\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body style=\"word-spacing:normal;\">\n<div class=\"mail-body\">\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\"><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n<div style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;text-align:center;\">\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td class=\"header-outlook\" width=\"600px\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"header-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\"><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"header\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:16px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;\">\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;width:600px;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr><td align=\"left\" class=\"light-img\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;border-spacing:0px;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"width:100px;\">\n<img src=\"https://selfcare.pagopa.it/assets/logo_pagopacorp.png\" style=\"border:0;display:block;outline:none;text-decoration:none;height:auto;width:100%;font-size:13px;\" width=\"100\">\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"dark-img\" style=\"mso-hide:all;display:none;\">\n<td align=\"left\" style=\"mso-hide:all;font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<img src=\"https://selfcare.pagopa.it/assets/logo_pagopa_white.png\" width=\"100\" class=\"dark-img\" style=\"display:none;\">\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"section-outlook\" width=\"600px\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"section-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\"><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;\">\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;width:600px;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr><td align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:16px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:bold;line-height:1;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\">\n<h1 style=\"font-size:32px;line-height:40px;margin:0\">Un ente ti ha scelto come Partner tecnologico</h1>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:0px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:regular;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px\">Ciao,</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:0px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;font-weight:regular;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px\">l'ente <strong>{{institutionName}}</strong> ha aggiunto <strong>{{partnerName}}</strong> come Partner tecnologico per la gestione del prodotto <strong>{{productName}}</strong>.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px\">Per operare sul prodotto, entra in <u><a href=\"https://selfcare.pagopa.it/auth/login\" style=\"color:#0073e6\" class=\"link\">Area Riservata.</a></u> Se sei un Amministratore, potrai anche aggiungere nuovi utenti.</p>\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px\">Se hai problemi tecnici o domande in merito al funzionamento dell'Area Riservata, scrivi a <a href=\"mailto:areariservata@assistenza.pagopa.it\" style=\"color:#0073e6\" class=\"link\">areariservata@assistenza.pagopa.it</a>.</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr><td align=\"left\" class=\"text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-bottom:0px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:24px;text-align:left;color:#17324D;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px\">A presto,<br aria-hidden=\"true\">il team di PagoPA S.p.A.</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"section-outlook\" width=\"600px\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"section-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\"><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:0px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;\">\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;width:600px;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;padding-top:16px;padding-bottom:16px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<p style=\"border-top:solid 1px lightgrey;font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:100%;\"></p>\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"border-top:solid 1px lightgrey;font-size:1px;margin:0px auto;width:550px;\" role=\"presentation\" width=\"550px\"><tr><td style=\"height:0;line-height:0;\"> &nbsp;\n</td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr><tr><td class=\"section-outlook\" width=\"600px\"><table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"section-outlook\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:600px;\" width=\"600\"><tr><td style=\"line-height:0px;font-size:0px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"section\" style=\"margin:0px auto;max-width:600px;\">\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"width:100%;\">\n<tbody><tr><td style=\"direction:ltr;font-size:0px;padding:20px 0;padding-bottom:16px;padding-top:0px;text-align:center;\">\n<!--[if mso | IE]><table role=\"presentation\" border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\"><tr><td style=\"vertical-align:top;width:600px;\"><![endif]-->\n<div class=\"mj-column-per-100 mj-outlook-group-fix\" style=\"font-size:0px;text-align:left;direction:ltr;display:inline-block;vertical-align:top;width:100%;\">\n<table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" role=\"presentation\" style=\"vertical-align:top;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody><tr><td align=\"left\" class=\"footer-text\" style=\"font-size:0px;padding:10px 25px;word-break:break-word;\">\n<div style=\"font-family:Titillium Web, system-ui, sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:20px;text-align:left;color:#5C6F82;\">\n<p style=\"margin-top:0px\">Ricevi questo messaggio perch&eacute; hai un&rsquo;utenza attiva nell&rsquo;Area Riservata dell&rsquo;ente.</p>\n</div>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<!--[if mso | IE]></td></tr></table><![endif]-->\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>",
    "Subject": "un ente ti ha scelto come Partner tecnologico",
    "Text": "Un ente ti ha scelto come Partner tecnologico\nCiao,\nl'ente {{institutionName}} ha aggiunto {{partnerName}} come Partner tecnologico per la gestione del prodotto {{productName}}.\nPer operare sul prodotto, entra in Area Riservata (https://selfcare.pagopa.it/auth/login). Se sei un Amministratore, potrai anche aggiungere nuovi utenti.\nSe hai problemi tecnici o domande in merito al funzionamento dell'Area Riservata, scrivi a areariservata@assistenza.pagopa.it (mailto:areariservata@assistenza.pagopa.it).\nA presto,\nil team di PagoPA S.p.A.\nRicevi questo messaggio perché hai un’utenza attiva nell’Area Riservata dell’ente."
  },
